{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.RingTheory.PowerSeries.Inverse","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.qDilogInv_functional","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.qDilogInv_functional","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.lean#L82-L101","doc":"**Functional equation** (the defining `q`-difference equation of the\ncompact quantum dilogarithm):\n$$\\Phi_q(q^2 x)^{-1} \\;=\\; (1 + q\\,x)\\,\\Phi_q(x)^{-1},$$\nhere as `rescale (q²) Φ_q^{-1} = (1 + C q · X) · Φ_q^{-1}` in `R[[q]][[x]]`\n(`q := (X : R[[q]])`, `x := (X : R[[q]][[x]])`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.oneSubQPow_mul_coeffSeq_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.oneSubQPow_mul_coeffSeq_succ","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.lean#L67-L80","doc":"**`q`-difference recurrence** (the defining relation), cleared of the\ninverse: `(1 - q^{2(k+1)}) · a_{k+1} = -q · a_k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.coeff_qDilogInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.coeff_qDilogInv","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.lean#L63-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.qDilogInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.qDilogInv","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.lean#L60-L61","doc":"The genuine infinite reciprocal quantum dilogarithm `Φ_q^{-1} ∈ R[[q]][[x]]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.coeffSeq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.coeffSeq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.coeffSeq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.coeffSeq","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.lean#L52-L56","doc":"The `x^k` coefficient of `Φ_q^{-1}`, an element of `R[[q]]`, defined by the\n`q`-difference recurrence `a_{k+1} = -q · a_k · (1 - q^{2(k+1)})⁻¹`, `a_0 = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.constantCoeff_oneSubQPow_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.constantCoeff_oneSubQPow_succ","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.lean#L47-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.oneSubQPow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.oneSubQPow","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.lean#L43-L45","doc":"`1 - q^{2k}` as an element of `R[[q]]`; a unit, since its constant term\nis `1` (the `q^{2k}` term has no constant part for `k ≥ 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.QSeries","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.QSeries","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/QuantumDilogarithmInfinite.lean#L40-L41","doc":"The coefficient ring `R[[q]]`, with `q := X`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}